# Settings > Updates (report 047 P1, D11): the first start of 0.8.12 after 0.8.11 (the state file says 0.8.11 was the
# last version seen; the cached answer of an earlier check is there): one toast "Updated to 0.8.12" pointing at
# Settings > Updates; offline, What's new shows the notes of the update (0.8.12, from the cached list). Then the D3
# toast: the background check (its first look 2 min after the start; the home grid in front) finds 0.8.13, one toast.
# Review only: no golden.
title updates toasts
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 720x720
@480x800 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-05
wifi 70
bt on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update state last_shown 0.8.11
update state last_check now-200000
update state result ok
update cache releases-real.json
home
wait 300
shot updates_toast_updated
expect_text end "What's new: Settings > Updates"
wait 7000
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_toast_launcher
expect_text "What's new in 0.8.12"
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_toast_whatsnew
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
wait 500
# the daily check: due (the last one 2 days ago), the network now up, the home grid in front
update net on
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
wait 107500
shot updates_toast_available
expect_text end "Settings > Updates"
